the person we're interacting with and

00:03:47.700 --> 00:03:53.190
kind of start to you know shape them the
way that they are rather than letting

00:03:53.190 --> 00:03:58.980
them be they're kind of unique selves so
those are thinking a lot about this

00:03:58.980 --> 00:04:03.540
